{"pin":"BH00133","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00133","anchor":"","first_line":"If there be found a soul steadfast, firm, assured and upright, which, for the love of God and His good-pleasure, standeth even as a banner [3.5s]... ...Praise be unto Thee, O my God! I render Thee thanks for having rescued me from the abyss of self and passion, led me unto Thy straight path and Thy most great announcement","first_line_orig":"اگر نفس ثابت راسخ مطمئن مستقیمی یافت شود و لوجه الله و حبه و رضائه بمثابه علم  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"3730","translations":[{"language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA15:219","source":"INBA15","locator":"219","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v015/?page=111"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA26:220","source":"INBA26","locator":"220","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v026/?page=111"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA30:112ax","source":"INBA30","locator":"112ax","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v030/?page=60"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ABDA.331-343","source":"ABDA","locator":"331-343","url":"https://adibmasumian.files.wordpress.com/2021/02/abda.pdf#page=339"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADH1.100x","source":"ADH1","locator":"100x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/pdf/i/ishraq-khavari_adhkar_muqarrabin_1.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AHM.065x","source":"AHM","locator":"065x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/AHM/ahm-65.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AKHA_131BE #07 p.ax","source":"AKHA_131BE #07 p.ax","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/akhbar-i-amri/"},{"kind":"publication","code":"NSR_1993.021x","source":"NSR_1993","locator":"021x","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/NR1/nr1-19.html"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BLO_PT#067x","source":"BLO_PT","locator":"067x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahaullah_adiyyih_hadrat_mahbub"},{"kind":"translation","code":"GPB.190x","source":"GPB","locator":"190x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r